		(descr "JUSHUO AFA07-S20FCC-00 (LCSC C262352): FFC/FPC ZIF 1.0mm 20P, horizontal/side entry, BOTTOM contacts, slide-lock drawer, 2.5mm height. Land per customer drawing: 20x 0.6x1.8 @1.0mm + 2 nail pads 2.6x3.0 at (+-11.85, +2.17 rel pad row). Cable opening faces -y. Same family/land rule as ffc_afa07_s16fcc (nail pad = (N-1)/2*pitch + 2.35); this is the v0.27 20-way part that carries VBAT_CELL across the bridge alongside the matrix, replacing the separate battery cable.")
